==History==
2016
*The Skeletons [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 19/2/2016, the [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/2/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Skeletons' hitpoints and damage by 11%.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], decreased the Skeletons' sight range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Common}} card Level cap to 13 (from 12). The update also fixed the “range bug”, which decreased the Skeletons' range to 0.5 tiles (from 0.75 tiles), but their effective range was unchanged.
*On 18/5/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (18/5/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Skeletons' hitpoints and damage by 5%.
*On 21/6/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (21/6/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the number of Skeletons spawned to 3 (from 4). This also changed the numeral "Four" to "Three" in the description and replaced "swarm" with "surround" due to the lower number of Skeletons.
2017
*On 13/2/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (13/2/2017)|Balance Update]], increased the number of Skeletons spawned to 4 (from 3). This also changed the numeral "Three" to "Four" in the description.
*On 12/6/2017, the [[Version History#June 2017 Update (12/6/2017)|June 2017 Update]], decreased the number of Skeletons spawned to 3 (from 4). It also increased the distance between the Skeletons upon deployment. This changed the numeral "Four" to "Three" in the description.
2019
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Skeletons' card info screen.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14), and added the Skeletons' Evolution. It also changed the Skeletons' card image.
2025
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] made it so that the [[Witch/Evolution|Evolved Witch]] would no longer be healed by defeated Skeletons.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] increased the Skeleton's attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1 second).

